OL,3,ATrump hails 'historic' deal for US to
OL,4,Acontrol 65bn barrels of Venezuela's oil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has struck a deal with Venezuela
OL,7,Fto control more than 65 billion barrels
OL,8,Fof its proven oil reserves, Donald
OL,9,FTrump announced.
OL,11,FThe US president wrote that the
OL,12,Fagreement would more than double
OL,13,FAmerican oil reserves and
OL,14,F"substantially lower Gas Prices for all
OL,15,FAmericans".
OL,17,FVenezuela's interim President Delcy
OL,18,FRodriguez hailed the deal as one that
OL,19,Fwould help her nation's economic
OL,20,Frevival.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
